xture management via RDM (ANSI E1.20) over ArtNet/sACN. Integrates with grandMA2 (Telnet) and grandMA3 (OSC), imports MVR files for fixture layout, runs ArtPoll node discovery, and includes a DHCP server for lighting network setup.","docker_registry":"https://ghcr.io","image_src":"rdm-fixture-manager.svg","categories":["Utilities","Development"],"architecture":["amd64"],"notes":"IMPORTANT: This workspace requires --network=host (already set) for ArtNet UDP broadcast and sACN multicast to reach the lighting rig.\n\nPort 80: RDM Fixture Manager web UI\n/ola/ proxies the OLA daemon web interface on port 9090\n\nA host volume /opt/rdm-data is mounted at /app/data for persistent show files.\n\nThe host must be on the same subnet as your DMX/ArtNet nodes (Luminex, ELC, etc.).","run_config":{"network_mode":"host","environment":{"DB_PATH":"/app/data/shows/default.db"},"volumes":{"/{username}/rdm-fixture-manager":{"bind":"/app/data","mode":"rw","uid":1000,"gid":1000}}},"compatibility":[{"version":"1.18.x","image":"ghcr.io/perspective0labs/rdm-fixture-manager:latest","uncompressed_size_mb":1800,"available_tags":["latest"]}],"sha":"0cde3e4783d0d5da202ca07dff181aef2ec5e8c3"},{"friendly_name":"RetroArch","description":"RetroArch multi-system emulator frontend streamed via Kasm.","docker_registry":"https://ghcr.io","image_src":"ra.svg","categories":["Utilities","Media"],"architecture":["amd64"],"compatibility":[{"version":"1.18.x","image":"ghcr.io/perspective0labs/retroarch:latest","uncompressed_size_mb":4500,"available_tags":["latest"]}],"sha":"92ad53432f1b2be44c278a865f0794cf48a84129"},{"friendly_name":"Signal","description":"Signal private messenger desktop app streamed via Kasm.","docker_registry":"https://ghcr.io","image_src":"sig.svg","categories":["Utilities"],"architecture":["amd64"],"compatibility":[{"version":"1.18.x","image":"ghcr.io/perspective0labs/signal:latest","uncompressed_size_mb":2800,"available_tags":["latest"]}],"sha":"01894db719a5405e590510f85825d6c2f21859f9